    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D.A.W.N: Darkness Awaits Withstand the Night is a fast-paced zombie survival game that puts you in the shoes of an elite survivor battling against the relentless undead. During the day, you strategize, gather supplies, and prepare your defenses. But when night falls, the real challenge begins as hordes of zombies emerge, driven by their hunger for human flesh. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by \u2018I Am Legend\u2019 and \u2018World War Z,\u2019 D.A.W.N offers an intense survival experience that blends action, strategy, and team-based gameplay. Explore a post-apocalyptic world, confront dynamic zombie evolutions, and adapt your tactics to outlast the ever-growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tDynamic Day/Night Cycle: Gather resources, plan your strategies, and prepare defenses during the day to survive the night\u2019s onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tEvolving Zombies: The longer the undead roam, the more dangerous they become. Face different tiers of zombies, each with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tSurvival Simulation: No endless waves. Players must find extraction points to escape or face permanent death as their reanimated corpse joins the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tLoadout System: Choose from a variety of weapons and equipment to suit your playstyle. Balance strengths and weaknesses to tackle various threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tTeam Play: Join forces with others to survive the night, set traps, and fend off hordes in this open-ended survival simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tFast-Paced Combat: Engage in high-intensity battles that require skill, strategy, and quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to face the darkness. Will you survive until dawn?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D.A.W.N: Darkness Awaits Withstand the Night is a fast-paced zombie survival game that puts you in the shoes of an elite survivor battling against the relentless undead. During the day, you strategize, gather supplies, and prepare your defenses. But when night falls, the real challenge begins as hordes of zombies emerge, driven by their hunger for human flesh. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by \u2018I Am Legend\u2019 and \u2018World War Z,\u2019 D.A.W.N offers an intense survival experience that blends action, strategy, and team-based gameplay. Explore a post-apocalyptic world, confront dynamic zombie evolutions, and adapt your tactics to outlast the ever-growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tDynamic Day/Night Cycle: Gather resources, plan your strategies, and prepare defenses during the day to survive the night\u2019s onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tEvolving Zombies: The longer the undead roam, the more dangerous they become. Face different tiers of zombies, each with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tSurvival Simulation: No endless waves. Players must find extraction points to escape or face permanent death as their reanimated corpse joins the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tLoadout System: Choose from a variety of weapons and equipment to suit your playstyle. Balance strengths and weaknesses to tackle various threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tTeam Play: Join forces with others to survive the night, set traps, and fend off hordes in this open-ended survival simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u2022\tFast-Paced Combat: Engage in high-intensity battles that require skill, strategy, and quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to face the darkness. Will you survive until dawn?</p>",
